Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":913,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914761,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1468141751,"LastPoster":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1916675,"PostDate":1478600268,"PostContent":"@JamaicaNicole sorry to hear about your frustrating situation. Our fingers are crossed that your...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464777939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.249.52.69","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ece3f361d24482749d9c31ab4f567355","RawContent":"We just got married in Jamaica and I haven&#039;t received the pictures yet but I am unhappy with the photographer. The first thing that annoyed me is that I was expecting to get the main photographer for the company. It was a week before the wedding and I hadn&#039;t had any communication confirming anything so I reached out, only to find they would be sending one of his employees. I expressed my concern since when I booked he said it would most likely be him shooting he reassured me everything would be fine though. \n\n\nOn the wedding day I had no communication from the photographer which would have been nice because I had to confirm with my wedding planner she even showed up. We really wanted sunset photos and there is such a small time frame to get them, our photographers external flash stopped working during this and she was messing with it for at least 15-20 minutes. At that time my husband and I started taking pictures with our phone as to not miss the sunset completely. While my dad ran back to the reception to get his camera. After that she sat down on a bench for another 20 minutes trying to figure out her external flash. For all the money you pay them shouldn&#039;t they have a back up. Not to mention we will never be able to get the perfect sunset picture because the moment was missed.\n\n\nThis is not a huge deal but then my photographer ended up dancing with my guests on not one but at least 3 songs. I am paying them they should be capturing these moments not dancing\n\n\nI have not received the pictures yet and they might have turned out great so I am waiting to say anything to the photographer who owns the company until then but I just had to vent my frustration.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914761,"PostDate":1468141751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We just got married in Jamaica and I haven't received the pictures yet but I am unhappy with the photographer. The first thing that annoyed me is that I was expecting to get the main photographer for the company. It was a week before the wedding and I hadn't had any communication confirming anything so I reached out, only to find they would be sending one of his employees. I expressed my concern since when I booked he said it would most likely be him shooting he reassured me everything would be fine though. <br><br>\nOn the wedding day I had no communication from the photographer which would have been nice because I had to confirm with my wedding planner she even showed up. We really wanted sunset photos and there is such a small time frame to get them, our photographers external flash stopped working during this and she was messing with it for at least 15-20 minutes. At that time my husband and I started taking pictures with our phone as to not miss the sunset completely. While my dad ran back to the reception to get his camera. After that she sat down on a bench for another 20 minutes trying to figure out her external flash. For all the money you pay them shouldn't they have a back up. Not to mention we will never be able to get the perfect sunset picture because the moment was missed.<br><br>\nThis is not a huge deal but then my photographer ended up dancing with my guests on not one but at least 3 songs. I am paying them they should be capturing these moments not dancing<br><br>\nI have not received the pictures yet and they might have turned out great so I am waiting to say anything to the photographer who owns the company until then but I just had to vent my frustration.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407418909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.202.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c19f3e236d223f3dfbd1f6385a1daa41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JamaicaNicole\"] Oh no! such a shame of the sunset experience, Secrets Montego Bay is a really nice resort chain, perhaps they would be available to help you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also shoot in Jamaica if you need something we will be glad to help you&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18203]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914791,"PostDate":1468243627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279353\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279353-jamaicanicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JamaicaNicole<\/span><\/a> Oh no! such a shame of the sunset experience, Secrets Montego Bay is a really nice resort chain, perhaps they would be available to help you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also shoot in Jamaica if you need something we will be glad to help you<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18203-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18203\/tn_gallery_287113_18203_1056790.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='jam2'  width='75' height='75'  alt='jam2' id='tn_image_view_83640_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18203-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Jamaica<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>15 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1465476801,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1475417295","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"137.186.98.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16240497917a787398001172b18fb99d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JamaicaNicole\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That is horrible girl. I totally understand your frustrations though and wanting to get it all out. I didn&#039;t have any bad experiences with my photographer (got married in DR in April 17, 2015) which I am thankful for because the pictures were so important to me. Don&#039;t stress over it yet though. Good idea until waiting until you get the pictures back. Make sure to show some of them when you get them Would love to see them regardless.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Oh and I am learning photography now myself since like a little over a year ago. So hearing this stories helps me learn from others mistakes that&#039;s for sure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Chin up girl.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914812,"PostDate":1468277008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279353\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279353-jamaicanicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JamaicaNicole<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is horrible girl. I totally understand your frustrations though and wanting to get it all out. I didn't have any bad experiences with my photographer (got married in DR in April 17, 2015) which I am thankful for because the pictures were so important to me. Don't stress over it yet though. Good idea until waiting until you get the pictures back. Make sure to show some of them when you get them Would love to see them regardless.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Oh and I am learning photography now myself since like a little over a year ago. So hearing this stories helps me learn from others mistakes that's for sure.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Chin up girl.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395328614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.36.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fae7dc303620655bed952a8445cca4c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1914761\" timestamp=\"1468159751\"]\nWe just got married in Jamaica and I haven&#039;t received the pictures yet but I am unhappy with the photographer. The first thing that annoyed me is that I was expecting to get the main photographer for the company. It was a week before the wedding and I hadn&#039;t had any communication confirming anything so I reached out, only to find they would be sending one of his employees. I expressed my concern since when I booked he said it would most likely be him shooting he reassured me everything would be fine though.\n\nOn the wedding day I had no communication from the photographer which would have been nice because I had to confirm with my wedding planner she even showed up. We really wanted sunset photos and there is such a small time frame to get them, our photographers external flash stopped working during this and she was messing with it for at least 15-20 minutes. At that time my husband and I started taking pictures with our phone as to not miss the sunset completely. While my dad ran back to the reception to get his camera. After that she sat down on a bench for another 20 minutes trying to figure out her external flash. For all the money you pay them shouldn&#039;t they have a back up. Not to mention we will never be able to get the perfect sunset picture because the moment was missed.\n\nThis is not a huge deal but then my photographer ended up dancing with my guests on not one but at least 3 songs. I am paying them they should be capturing these moments not dancing\n\nI have not received the pictures yet and they might have turned out great so I am waiting to say anything to the photographer who owns the company until then but I just had to vent my frustration.[\/quote]@[member=\"kcole123\"] I would definitely make sure the know about your frustration, so their next client doesnt experience this.  Once you have your photo please do come back and share with us.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914834,"PostDate":1468348430,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on 10 July 2016 - 09:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We just got married in Jamaica and I haven't received the pictures yet but I am unhappy with the photographer. The first thing that annoyed me is that I was expecting to get the main photographer for the company. It was a week before the wedding and I hadn't had any communication confirming anything so I reached out, only to find they would be sending one of his employees. I expressed my concern since when I booked he said it would most likely be him shooting he reassured me everything would be fine though.<br><br>\nOn the wedding day I had no communication from the photographer which would have been nice because I had to confirm with my wedding planner she even showed up. We really wanted sunset photos and there is such a small time frame to get them, our photographers external flash stopped working during this and she was messing with it for at least 15-20 minutes. At that time my husband and I started taking pictures with our phone as to not miss the sunset completely. While my dad ran back to the reception to get his camera. After that she sat down on a bench for another 20 minutes trying to figure out her external flash. For all the money you pay them shouldn't they have a back up. Not to mention we will never be able to get the perfect sunset picture because the moment was missed.<br><br>\nThis is not a huge deal but then my photographer ended up dancing with my guests on not one but at least 3 songs. I am paying them they should be capturing these moments not dancing<br><br>\nI have not received the pictures yet and they might have turned out great so I am waiting to say anything to the photographer who owns the company until then but I just had to vent my frustration.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277264-kcole123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kcole123<\/span><\/a> I would definitely make sure the know about your frustration, so their next client doesnt experience this. \u00a0Once you have your photo please do come back and share with us.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.173.206.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by margretAA, 01 September 2016 - 02:34 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1472697268,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffdbf48a7a21bbf1f9f8a3121dde11f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is a really bad experience for you. In such memorable events, every arrangement should be in line. During my wedding, I also faced photographer problem. But this problem was sorted out when we booked our wedding function at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/photography\/&#039;&gt;all &amp;nbsp;inclusive wedding venue&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915527,"PostDate":1472697145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is a really bad experience for you. In such memorable events, every arrangement should be in line. During my wedding, I also faced photographer problem. But this problem was sorted out when we booked our wedding function at <a href='http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/photography\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>all \u00a0inclusive wedding venue<\/a>.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msginnie4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.173.33.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454470020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"margretAA","Id":286119,"Name":"margretAA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.194.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"996549795907e4e60feae351e02d624c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing your experience, JamaicaNicole - it&#039;s sure to help others decide how to proceed when hiring a photographer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s also good to hear about your patience and waiting to see the photos before making a final judgement. We wish you all the best, and that the images you receive are stunningly beautiful!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your amazing life journey ahead, and kick up your heels, cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b7092ec973f7490da78c089896185941.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b7092ec973f7490da78c089896185941.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b7092ec973f7490da78c089896185941.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915537,"PostDate":1472812038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing your experience, JamaicaNicole - it's sure to help others decide how to proceed when hiring a photographer.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's also good to hear about your patience and waiting to see the photos before making a final judgement. We wish you all the best, and that the images you receive are stunningly beautiful!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy your amazing life journey ahead, and kick up your heels, cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b7092ec973f7490da78c089896185941.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b7092ec973f7490da78c089896185941.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b7092ec973f7490da78c089896185941.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"180.191.115.97","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8a5edb5fe86ae33839981ebb959b98b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;oh no! pictures are very important! i hope the pictures turn out good despite the setbacks....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916473,"PostDate":1476695796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>oh no! pictures are very important! i hope the pictures turn out good despite the setbacks....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cjapaez@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"180.191.115.97","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1476694631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Chris2017","Id":287903,"Name":"Chris2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"110.225.212.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"615f978db5c7ac9497cb5561e9992ce3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s really bad!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;For any events in the future, Start looking for a booth rental company in advance, because during the wedding season good companies are usually high in demand. Budget flexibility is also important because it is very difficult to find a reliable, service provider at lower cost.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916653,"PostDate":1478138896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It's really bad!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">For any events in the future, Start looking for a booth rental company in advance, because during the wedding season good companies are usually high in demand. Budget flexibility is also important because it is very difficult to find a reliable, service provider at lower cost.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photoworksinteractive.com\/'>photo booth rentals san jose<\/a>","Email":"rodriguezsmith54@gmail.com","IpAddress":"110.225.212.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1478138581,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodriguezsmith","Id":287987,"Name":"rodriguezsmith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.29.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80183,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77a5dc7ebb9052d61712ea796917250c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JamaicaNicole\"] sorry to hear about your frustrating situation. Our fingers are crossed that your wedding photos are beautiful and exactly what you&#039;re hoping for. &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916675,"PostDate":1478600268,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279353\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279353-jamaicanicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JamaicaNicole<\/span><\/a> sorry to hear about your frustrating situation. Our fingers are crossed that your wedding photos are beautiful and exactly what you're hoping for. <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1916675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-287055-0-19687100-1478618258.jpg\" title=\"Kristi_Gord_Teaser_15.jpg - Size: 105.8KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-287055-0-19687100-1478618258.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Kristi_Gord_Teaser_15.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464777939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80183","Title":"Unhappy With Wedding Photographer","LastPostDate":1478600268},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
