actly how to do it, what exactly I needed and the measurements, so I&#039;m glad this helped someone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1452005,"PostDate":1305459455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Oh good! I am happy that it is helpful!\u00a0 I spent so many hours searching for exactly how to do it, what exactly I needed and the measurements, so I'm glad this helped someone!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>Azul Beach, Riviera Maya, October 22, 2011!<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Our website: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mikeandmandywedding.org\">http:\/\/www.mikeandmandywedding.org<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mandy.borgeson@ucdenver.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1298047290,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236940.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mnicole20","Id":236940,"Name":"mnicole20","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"P