{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78989,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e85ff3b5ce4677c2a367a988dd2ce597","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Pick a theme like Nautical or Royalty and run with it\n\nThe guests will love how you can turn an ordinary space into something wonderful&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913496,"PostDate":1462881925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Pick a theme like Nautical or Royalty and run with it<br>\nThe guests will love how you can turn an ordinary space into something wonderful<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462864536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.173.205.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78989,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d386b372a1c13df745f78cb24a3f2301","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It is the mistake on their side, if they have wrongly charged you for private function instead of semi private function, you must bring this fact before them. But if you want to go ahead, then follow their advice and do accordingly. As this is the prestigious function, so go ahead with the function. I am sharing my similar experience here. I got married in Houston and we booked House Plantation wedding venue. I booked the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/outdoor-weddings\/&#039;&gt;venue for outdoor lake side function &lt;\/a&gt;and all services like catering, decorations etc, I hired from outside. As this was all inclusive wedding venue , they charged me for other services also and told me that they do not allow outsiders services here. There was no other option before me, so I &amp;nbsp;cancelled all outdoor services and paid them required amount.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916805,"PostDate":1480297234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It is the mistake on their side, if they have wrongly charged you for private function instead of semi private function, you must bring this fact before them. But if you want to go ahead, then follow their advice and do accordingly. As this is the prestigious function, so go ahead with the function. I am sharing my similar experience here. I got married in Houston and we booked House Plantation wedding venue. I booked the <a href='http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/outdoor-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>venue for outdoor lake side function <\/a>and all services like catering, decorations etc, I hired from outside. As this was all inclusive wedding venue , they charged me for other services also and told me that they do not allow outsiders services here. There was no other option before me, so I \u00a0cancelled all outdoor services and paid them required amount.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msginnie4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.173.33.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454470020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"margretAA","Id":286119,"Name":"margretAA","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
